{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54132","headline":"词 四 · 邵谒","name":"词 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池中赤鲤庖所捐，琴高乘去飞上天。\n命逢福世丁溢恩，簪巾藉绮昇曲筵。\n恩厚德深委如山，洁诚洗志期暮年，乌臼马角宁足言。\n（影印本《诗渊》第六册第四一一五页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}